[0.021, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 39 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`manifest-token`'s refusals.                                                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 39 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`manifest-token`'s refusals. `bundle_smoke` runs the build tree as a distribution is run, every        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 40 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mplace its default, in a new HOME (`scripts/bundle-smoke.sh`).                                          \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m41\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 42 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`clang-release` is the distribution build (`MANIFEST_DISTRIBUTION`,                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 43 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe distribution\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-5-recovery-plan.md#the-distribution-r07-2026-11-24)): its four executables    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 44 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mload through `/lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2`, so its tests need a loader there, nix-ld on NixOS, and     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 45 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mits `distribution` test fails on a symbol newer than glibc 2.39, to be bound in                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 46 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`source/apps/distribution/GlibcFloor.cpp`. `scripts/stage-bundle.sh` stages the tarball from a clean   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 47 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcheckout into `build/bundle`; `scripts/test-bundle.sh <tarball>` runs it from a read-only directory    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 48 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242munder `env -i` here and in Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 13 containers, which needs Docker.                  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m49 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \u001b[14G           \u001b[26G   \u001b[30G \u001b[32G                                    \u001b[69G \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m50 \u001b[22m The\u001b[15GSDK\u001b[19Gimport\u001b[26Gboundary\u001b[35Gis\u001b[38G`source/external/CMakeLists.txt`.\u001b[72GWhether\u001b[80Git\u001b[83Gfetched\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gpin,\u001b[100Gtook\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m51 \u001b[22m `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR` or found a parent's SDK, config\u001b[65Gration fail\u001b[78Gunless every\u001b[91Gtarget and\u001b[102Ghelper\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m52 \u001b[22m Manifest\u001b[25Gexists, naming\u001b[40Ge\u001b[42Gch\u001b[45Gone missing. `sdk_import` configures Manifest und\u001b[95Gr\u001b[97Ga parent\u001b[106Gwith\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell c\u001b[22Gmand…\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mStart the Manifest ga\u001b[41Ge in the gate checkout · 29m 9s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m10\u001b[80G.0k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m1\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to inter\u001b[54Gupt · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
