the licences of eve\u001b[101Gy linked library.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/test-bundle.sh\u001b[28G\u001b[39mruns it\u001b[36Gon the \u001b[44Gost\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Gin\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gcontainers.\u001b[71G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/bundle-smoke.sh\u001b[95G\u001b[39mruns\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gfull\u001b[109Gsequence:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gstart, validate, is\u001b[25Gue a token,\u001b[37Gserve, connect the TUI, st\u001b[64Gp, restore.\u001b[76GIt\u001b[79Galso\u001b[84Gruns\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gtest\u001b[99Gon\u001b[102Gevery\u001b[108Gbuild\u001b[114Gtree.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEvidence:\u001b[13G\u001b[22mthe Manifest gate passed with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m.\u001b[67GThe\u001b[71Gtarball\u001b[79Gstaged\u001b[86Gfrom\u001b[91G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0ac13fe\u001b[99G\u001b[39mpassed\u001b[106G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest-bundle.sh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mfrom a read-only\u001b[20Gdirectory \u001b[31Gnder \u001b[38;2;177;185;249menv -i\u001b[39m on\u001b[46Gthis machin\u001b[58G and in both containers, with no network.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings to know\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The release p\u001b[19Gese\u001b[23G's tests \u001b[33Gow nee\u001b[41Ga l\u001b[45Gader at \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/lib64\u001b[39m, which mea\u001b[71Gs n\u001b[75Gx-ld on NixOS.\u001b[90GIf t\u001b[95Ge laptop doesn't have\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  nix-ld, its release stage\u001b[31Gwill f\u001b[38Gil.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GCI\u001b[8Ghasn't\u001b[15Gbeen\u001b[20Gchecked.\u001b[29GIt\u001b[32Gshould\u001b[39Grun\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gshipped\u001b[55Gbinaries\u001b[64Gagainst\u001b[72GUbuntu\u001b[79G24.04's\u001b[87Gglibc\u001b[93G2.39\u001b[98Gdirectly,\u001b[108Gbut\u001b[112GI\u001b[114Gcan't\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  confirm that until the commits\u001b[36Gare\u001b[40Gpushed.\u001