store. It also runs as a test on \u001b[103Gvery build tr\u001b[117Ge.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEvidence:\u001b[13G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[17GManifest\u001b[26Ggate\u001b[31Gpassed\u001b[38Gwith\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m.\u001b[67GThe\u001b[71Gtarball\u001b[79Gstaged\u001b[86Gfrom\u001b[91G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0ac13fe\u001b[99G\u001b[39mpassed\u001b[106G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest-bundle.sh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mfrom a read-only directory under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249menv -i\u001b[43G\u001b[39mon this machine and in both\u001b[71Gcont\u001b[76Giners, with no\u001b[91Gnetwork.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings to know\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The release preset's\u001b[26Gtests\u001b[32Gnow\u001b[36Gneed\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Gloader\u001b[50Gat\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/lib64\u001b[39m,\u001b[61Gwhich\u001b[67Gmeans\u001b[73Gnix-ld\u001b[80Gon\u001b[83GNixOS.\u001b[90GIf\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Glaptop\u001b[104Gdoesn't\u001b[112Ghave\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnix-ld, its\u001b[17Grelease s\u001b[27Gage will\u001b[36Gfail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GCI hasn't been checked. It should run\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gshipped\u001b[55Gbinaries\u001b[64Gagainst\u001b[72GUbuntu\u001b[79G24.04's\u001b[87Gglibc\u001b[93G2.39\u001b[98Gdirectly,\u001b[108Gbut\u001b[112GI\u001b[114Gcan't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gconfirm \u001b[14Ghat until the commits are pushed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest-bundle.sh\u001b[39m needs Do\u001b[29Gker, \u001b[35Go it\u001b[40Gis run by\u001b[50Ghand\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Gis\u001b[62Gnot\u001b[66Gin\u001b[69GCI.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibstdc++\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibgcc\u001b[39m's licence text isn't\u001b[77GGCC's\u001b[83GRuntime\u001b[91GLibrary\u001b[99GException,\u001b[110Gwhich\u001b[116GI\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
